        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recently, the protagonist quit his job.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to reflect on himself, he looks back on his life and recalls the faces of the people he has encountered along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short memory game that uses human faces.<br>Match a pair of identical faces to clear them from the table.<br>If you flip the same card twice without finding its pair, you will lose one life.<br>Clear all the cards before losing three lives to complete the stage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Assist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you set &quot;Assist&quot; to &quot;On&quot; in the settings, you will be able to see which cards have not yet been flipped.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(A card with a white border indicates that it has not been flipped yet.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981180/extras/69de3ee38d90c7438b9ba20e6a97bce0.avif?t=1759053657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >About 1 hour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Streaming &amp; Video Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to record and share gameplay videos of this game, including livestreams, without needing prior permission—whether as an individual or a company. Please follow these guidelines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Include a link to this page in the video description or equivalent section.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is only allowed when using the official features provided by each video platform.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Any content that violates laws or public order and morals is strictly prohibited.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The developer assumes no responsibility for any damages arising from the posting or streaming of videos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>These guidelines are subject to change without prior notice.</i></p>",
